+# Final validation orchestrator
+
+What this does
+- Runs RT sweeps, HIL campaigns, simulation cluster runs, OOD collection + retrain trigger, provenance checks, carbon monitor and packages a signed evidence bundle.
+
+How to use
+- Edit ops/validation/final_validation_config.json with your targets, manifests, and desired parameters.
+- Run locally:
+  python3 ops/validation/final_validation_orchestrator.py --config ops/validation/final_validation_config.json --out /tmp/aegis_final_run --upload-s3 s3://aegis-evidence/<run-id>
