+  Use .github/workflows/final_validation_and_certify.yml to execute on self-hosted, labeled hardware runners.
+
+Operator responsibilities
+- Ensure cosign/rekor/apalache and vendor SDKs are installed on runners.
+- Review produced final_validation_summary.json and iterate on failures.
+- Upload signed bundle to certifier if required; use the cert_upload_url to let the orchestrator POST the bundle (certifier endpoint required).
